    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just spent 6 hours on hold and then the guy hangs up on me because my paperwork \"technically\" doesnt exist anymore even though i sent it weeks ago. like im just... gone. i dont even exist to them. it feels like the world is just a giant machine that is slowly erasing me bit by bit and there's nothing i can do to stop it.",
